    "sub": "We train a spherical graph convolutional network to infer the tensor-to-scalar ratio $r$ directly from multifrequency cosmic microwave background $B$-mode maps on the cut sky. We.",
    "sub_pt": "We train a spherical graph convolutional network to infer the tensor-to-scalar ratio $r$ directly from multifrequency cosmic microwave background $B$-mode maps on the cut sky. We.",
